# Frontend env (Vite). Copy to .env.local to override defaults.
#
# Defaults: with no values set, the app derives the backend URL from
# window.location:
#   - localhost / 127.0.0.1  -> http://localhost:3000/api/v1
#   - LAN host (e.g. 192.168.x.y) -> http://<same-host>:3000/api/v1
#   - https page -> https/wss
#
# Override only when you need a backend that doesn't follow that pattern
# (e.g. backend on a different host or port than the frontend).
#
# Vite reads .env files at dev-server startup. If you change values while
# `pnpm dev` is running, Vite usually reloads automatically; if it doesn't,
# restart the dev server.

# VITE_API_URL=http://192.168.4.82:3000/api/v1
# VITE_CABLE_URL=ws://192.168.4.82:3000/cable
